      ],
      "image": "assets/images/178295/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Cover a baking sheet with aluminum foil and grease with cooking spray. Grease a sheet of aluminum foil; set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix ground beef and onion soup mix together in a large skillet; cook and stir over medium-high heat until beef is crumbly and evenly browned, 5 to 7 minutes. Drain and discard any excess grease.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0PuUngwTIp10mQv3Qa2OaiLqi08=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/178295-Slider-Style-Mini-Burgers-ddmfs-Step2-4x3-0675-c974c81e08134834bf1091ac1f38f17d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/178295/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the skillet from heat; stir in Cheddar cheese and mayonnaise.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DCYlRiTrh-_kPzWxWAcosBuEV-s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/178295-Slider-Style-Mini-Burgers-ddmfs-Step3-4x3-0682-ef4349977c3b4302864b39a8e24aebb6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/178295/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place roll bottoms on the prepared baking sheet. Spread beef mixture onto each bottom; cover with bread roll tops. Cover sliders with the prepared sheet of aluminum foil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Evn-m6jVULLV00ZZZBN7R8jpwNk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/178295-Slider-Style-Mini-Burgers-ddmfs-Step4-4x3-0684-7093dcfcf2fc4fa18fe9bc008b5798dd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/178295/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until burger sliders are heated through and cheese is melted, about 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ib4LTLA670LFycjGxQgioZJPCY8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/178295-Slider-Style-Mini-Burgers-ddmfs-Step5-4x3-0716-4b3b3237fc7e4dcc97599df257353512.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/178295/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
